
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environment
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Python packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Test and coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# PyCharm
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python environment files
.python-version

# Log files
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp